meta {
  name: Delete Trip Day
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/trip-days/1
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  # Delete Trip Day

  Delete a trip day from the itinerary.

  ## URL Params
  - `{trip_day_id}`: ID of the trip day to delete

  ## Response
  - Success: 204 No Content
  - Not found: 404
  - No permission: 403

  ## Important Notes
  - Only trip owner can delete (for now)
  - This is a **hard delete** (permanent, not soft delete)
  - All associated data (activities, bookings, etc.) are deleted
  - Auto-updates trip destinations after deletion
  - Cannot be undone!

  ## Access Control
  - Must be trip owner
  - Cannot delete if not authorized
}
